# ApiError variant -> HTTP status -> machine-readable code (#465).
# This file is the published contract. A diff here is a breaking API change: never rename or
# reuse a code. Regenerate only when deliberately adding a variant.
BadRequest 400 bad_request
StaleSequence 400 stale_sequence
Unauthorized 401 unauthorized
Forbidden 403 forbidden
NotFound 404 not_found
Conflict 409 already_exists
ConflictWith 409 conflict
Gone 410 gone
TooManyRequests 429 too_many_requests
Internal 500 internal_error
GatewayTimeout 504 upstream_timeout
